{"full":"hf:build-small-hackathon/jungle-story-time","spaceId":"build-small-hackathon/jungle-story-time","name":"Jungle Story Time","source":"huggingface","description":"Personalized kids' stories with AI voice narration","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":9,"created":"2026-06-10T19:01:42.000Z","updated":"2026-06-15T11:30:37.000Z","license":"apache-2.0","runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://build-small-hackathon-jungle-story-time.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/jungle-story-time","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T21:22:26.340Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T21:22:26.340Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T21:22:26.340Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🦁","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["3 taps and GO. Pick a friend, pick a place, pick story-or-poem — a fine-tuned 1B model writes a gentle, personalized tale for your child, an illustration is painted for it, and it's read aloud in a sweet voice (or your own family's voice).","Built for the Build Small Hackathon (June 2026).","A 2–5 year old needs fast (no 30s waits), private (it hears your child's name), cheap (runs on the family laptop), and stylistically reliable (tiny sentences, sound words, a refrain repeated 3×). Style is exactly what small-model fine-tuning is good at. MiniCPM5-1B is a plain LlamaForCausalLM, so the whole Unsloth toolchain works with zero patches, and the Q4KM GGUF runs at 60 tokens/sec on an M-series MacBook CPU."],"features":["Animated storybook poster — per-scene backdrop (jungle/pond/night…), bouncing friend, floating decorations, staggered story lines, high-contrast cards.","Word-by-word streaming while the model writes.","AI illustration painted for each tale (cached so repeats are instant).","Voices — three designed narrator voices (synthesized by VoxCPM2 Voice Design, no real person), an instant browser-speech \"Robo\" option, and family-voice cloning (record 15s → the story is read in that voice; opt-in,…","Story movie — one picture + one narration clip per scene, stitched into a Ken-Burns video."],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/jungle-story-time/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"568d494affb1ff5d4d67f766a6901b5f16a9615b5fd7d60acff65bf6163c540e","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T21:22:26.480Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T21:22:26.480Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"3 taps and GO. Pick a friend, pick a place, pick story-or-poem — a fine-tuned 1B model writes a gentle, personalized tale for your child, an illustration is painted for it, and it's read aloud in a sweet voice (or your own family's voice).","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/jungle-story-time/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Built for the Build Small Hackathon (June 2026).","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/jungle-story-time/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"568d494affb1ff5d4d67f766a6901b5f16a9615b5fd7d60acff65bf6163c540e","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/jungle-story-time/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T21:22:26.480Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-15T11:30:37.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/jungle-story-time/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T21:22:26.480Z","hash":"568d494affb1ff5d4d67f766a6901b5f16a9615b5fd7d60acff65bf6163c540e","originalBytes":12915,"storedBytes":12915,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["story","modal","voice","model","gguf","app","image","deploy","gradio","jungle","minicpm5-1b","dataset","endpoint","modal.py","one","voxcpm2","child","llama.cpp","mode","stories","field","fine-tuned","finetune","illustration","lora","name","runs","serve","training","cpu","endpoints","family","finetune.py","generation","local","na